The following versioned catalogue files are separate open-data artefacts:

- `open-data/seed_peaks-v1.18.0-build45.json`: the active, geographically revised
  catalogue for version 1.18.0 (build 45).
- `open-data/seed_peaks-v1.17.0-build41.json`: the historical snapshot for
  version 1.17.0 (build 41), also used unchanged in version 1.18.0 (build 44).
  It is not the active build 45 catalogue.

