https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

These catalogue files incorporate attributed Kartverket material. CC BY 4.0
applies to source inputs where identified in the linked source metadata; the
publisher must retain service-specific rights confirmation for detailed
NHM/DTM inputs. This notice does not extend a source licence or grant rights
to map tiles. Reuse must retain
`© Kartverket`, link to the applicable Kartverket source terms and CC BY 4.0,
and indicate that Tind 100 selected, combined, calculated, rounded and ranked
the material. Suggested credits, according to the file reused:

- `Tind 100 catalogue v1.18.0 (build 45), based on data © Kartverket`.
- `Tind 100 catalogue snapshot v1.17.0 (build 41), used unchanged in v1.18.0
  (build 44), based on data © Kartverket`.

Kartverket has not endorsed or quality-assured Tind 100.

For the 653 new build 45 entries, elevations and representative summit
points were derived from Kartverket NHM/DTM through WCS: 651 extractions
on a 10 m grid and two individually documented extractions on a 1 m grid.
The 847 retained entries were not reverified by these extractions. Grid
spacing is not an accuracy guarantee.
WCS metadata: https://kartkatalog.geonorge.no/metadata/nasjonal-hoeydemodell-digital-terrengmodell-25833-wcs/0f0a0f38-00c4-4213-a9e5-2d861dc4abb0
Kartverket source terms: https://www.kartverket.no/api-og-data/vilkar-for-bruk

Geographic selection for build 45 uses Statistics Norway (SSB), Population on
1 km grids 2025, under NLOD 1.0. Tind 100 processed the data into straight-line
proximity estimates, not travel times or confirmation of public access.
SSB has not endorsed this selection.
Reuse of the build 45 selection must also retain the credit
`Source: Statistics Norway (SSB), population on 1 km grids 2025`,
the following SSB source and NLOD 1.0 links, and the notice describing
Tind 100's processing.
Source: https://kartkatalog.geonorge.no/Metadata/uuid/25c70158-5841-4801-8bf3-fc3c5adf5329
Licence: https://data.norge.no/nlod/no/1.0

